    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_CIV_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>米诺斯文明（天灾测试版）</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_CIV_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Minoan Civilization (Disaster Alpha)</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_CIV_ADJECTIVE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>米诺斯的</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_CIV_ADJECTIVE" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Minoan</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_LEADER_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>米诺斯</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_LEADER_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Minos</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_CIV_ABILITY_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>天灾共生</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_CIV_ABILITY_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Living with Catastrophe</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_CIV_ABILITY_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>己方国土每隔数回合额外尝试肥地灾害：洪水、火山、森林/雨林火、沙尘暴或暴风雪。没有合法目标则跳过；不召唤龙卷风、陨石或毁地事件。保留原生增产概率与恢复过程。神谕祭司也使用此白名单。</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_CIV_ABILITY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Extra cultivation disasters use a closed list: river floods, volcanoes, forest/jungle fires, dust storms and blizzards. Invalid sites are skipped; no tornado, meteor or terrain-destroying fallback. Native fertility probabilities and recovery remain. Oracle rituals use the same list.</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_LEADER_ABILITY_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>宫廷庇护</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_LEADER_ABILITY_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Palatial Shelter</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_LEADER_ABILITY_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>所有己方单位免受自然灾害的单位伤害，包括作战单位、开拓者和建造者，不限国境且不要求总督。开局额外获得总督头衔，默认1个，由你自行任命。七位专属总督沿用原名、肖像和晋升，默认目标两回合就位，并接入梁的原生结构防护。Lua只补受灾人口；受庇护城市按信仰获一次性科文。其他文明总督不变。特殊毁图效果及新增防护范围仍需实测。</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_LEADER_ABILITY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>All your units are protected from random-event unit damage, including military units, Settlers and Builders, regardless of territory or governors. Receive bonus Governor Titles at game start (default: one). Seven unique governors retain original names, portraits and promotions, with a two-turn establishment target and native Liang structural prevention. Lua compensates disaster population losses only; protected cities receive Faith-based knowledge. Other civilizations are unchanged. Special map destruction and new protection coverage require in-game testing.</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_SANCTUARY_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>峰顶圣所</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_SANCTUARY_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Peak Sanctuary</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_SANCTUARY_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>替代圣地，默认半价。保留普通圣地功能，火山、地热裂缝及泛滥平原提供额外信仰相邻。</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_SANCTUARY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Replaces the Holy Site at half cost by default. Additional Faith adjacency from volcanoes, geothermal fissures and floodplains.</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_SPECIAL_ADJACENCY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>来自危险自然地形的额外信仰。</Text>
    </Replace>
    <Replace Tag="LOC_MNS_SPECIAL_ADJACENCY" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Additional Faith from hazardous terrain.</Text>
    </Replace>
